SUMMARY:Veteran Family Fun Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:Maroochy RSL is proud to host a special day of family-friendly 
 fun in honour of our current and former serving personnel and their famili
 es. This FREE community event promises a relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere 
 with something for everyone\, including a live band\, magician\, competiti
 ons\, prizes\, balloon artist\, face painting and light refreshments. Comp
 limentary beer\, wine and soft drinks will be available\, with a licensed 
 area on site for the purchase of additional beverages. Admission is FREE. 
 Bookings are essential. GET YOUR FREE TICKETS HERE Proof of ADF service is
  required upon entry. Accepted forms of identification include: • Curren
 t Maroochy RSL Member\, Life Subscriber or Life Member card • RSL Sub Br
 anch card (members of other Sub Branches) • Australian Defence Force ID 
 • Defence Force discharge papers (must be presented with photo ID such a
 s a driver’s licence) • DVA Gold\, White or Orange Card (must be prese
 nted with photo ID) Each Veteran is entitled to bring one adult guest and 
 up to four children . If you require additional guests\, please contact in
 fo@maroochyrsl.com.au prior to the event.
